ds EA30 release-margin overlap with buck tolerance.\nInterrupted NAND writes can still fail. Test brownout ramps." (at 225 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4a0bad7b-3980-41a3-82c3-cf60a66236f9)) (text "InternalLDO mode; correctVOS/flash wait states/clocks. HSE_VALUE=8000000.\n480MHz requires compatible silicon/temperature. BOOT_ADD0/1 recovery.\nSWD primary; verifyUSBDFU and cold power cycle.\nRUN PC5/source-disable PE12 selected away from ROM output drive." (at 35 188 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9888eb8a-0db3-49a1-ae3a-97f4309a61fe)))
